    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Tech</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Mars</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 1–12</p><p>These wild artificials (p. 151) are small, agile, cat-sized bots programmed with animal behaviors for scavenging and hoarding.They scurry on spider-like legs across any available surface, collecting small objects that strike their interest. Collectors are fond of shiny electronics and powered items, which they hoard in rat-like warrens.They will attack if cornered or prevented from stealing.Their forelimbs have painful pincers for grabbing and retractable blades for cutting.</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Small Size (−10 to hit)</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Chameleon Skin, Electrical Sense, Grip Pads, Magnetic System</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 7 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 3, Death Rating 30.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 157.</em></p>",
    "notes": ""
